From fbff798e15cf4d3b5088e690e0b53288918f609a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Wakely <jwakely@redhat.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 12:10:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] libstdc++: Fix header name in pb_ds tutorial docs

In more proof that nobody cares about this code, the docs have been
giving the wrong names for the headers for many years.

libstdc++-v3/ChangeLog:

	* doc/xml/manual/policy_data_structures.xml: Fix header name in
	pb_ds examples.
	* doc/xml/manual/using.xml: Fix names for pb_ds headers.
	* doc/html/*: Regenerate.

(cherry picked from commit fcd77abe119da6c09c68b4aefbb9f22a66f85946)
